        <mxCell id="legt4" value="State / external" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="leg">
          <mxGeometry x="54" y="126" width="250" height="20" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;What changed vs today's workflow&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• The six-phase sequence is gone: the loop decides depth per pathway, follow-up searches, and when to stop — code no longer prescribes the path.&#xa;• Five of today's seven 'agents' (triage, planner, filter, both interpreters' fixed batching) collapse into the Decide step and the toolbelt.&#xa;• Budgets moved from prompts into tools (spend meters, rate limits); the exit gate and the loop backstops are the two things no decision can bypass.&#xa;• The notebook is new: resumable state, the frontend activity feed, and the evidence trail chat can quote when asked 'why'." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="1240" width="990" height="154" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
